{
  "id": "scn_waves_victory",
  "kind": "scene",
  "type": "credits",
  "name": "Waves victory",
  "notes": "ALL WAVES CLEARED! over the meadow sky, with the winning monster bobbing, the final time, level and kills. The run's time is checked against this monster's best waves time (best_time[entry]): if it never won a waves run before, or this run was faster, it becomes the new best and the screen says NEW BEST TIME! with a jingle, otherwise it shows the best time to beat. The best time is saved at once. Waves wins unlock nothing. Waves wins make no monster shiny (only a classic Alpha's shiny seed does): new_shiny is set to -1, so the items screen goes straight back to the menu. A winner that already was shiny shimmers here too. Every win also gives 3 items for the next run, picked at random, never the same one twice (3 different of the 5 floor items: prize_1-3), replacing any not used yet, and saves them with the rest; START opens the items screen (scn_prizes), which shows them and then goes on to the shiny screen or the menu. The run counts as finished for the garden (run_ended, saved with the rest, with the seed if it was picked up): when the menu opens next, every plant in the garden counts one more finished run (5 make it grow one step) and the seed is planted. After the items screen (and the shiny screen) it goes back to the menu.",
  "backdrop": "#58a8f0",
  "music": "mus_victory",
  "camera": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0,
    "bounds": "none"
  },
